; Concept 41 — the constraint solver. A LEAF: it forks concept 09's pipeline rather than
; extending concept 40's, so the solver is the only thing that is new and nothing depends on
; it. Forking 09 rather than 07 buys the strongest oracle the course has — the programs RUN,
; and their output must match swiftc byte for byte, which is what proves the solver picked the
; declaration the reader meant rather than merely a declaration.
; Contracts (given): token diagnostics types lexer ast tast parser constraints csgen sil
; silgen irgen driver. Skeletons (you edit): cssolver csapply.
(library
 (name swiftml_solver)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules
  token diagnostics types lexer ast tast parser constraints csgen csapply cssolver sil
  silgen irgen driver)
 (flags
  (:standard -warn-error -a)))

(dirs :standard \ solution)
